<title>JAPAN: Ibiden -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ibiden -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 39.24		vs	   31.31</p>
<p> Operating	    2.27		vs	  899    million</p>
<p> Current		2.16		vs	    1.13</p>
